  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 100eb (Premium) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Non-Concealable Weapons fired with the Archery, Handgun, or Shoulder Arms Skill that cannot load Slugs and/or Shells except Bows</p>\n<p><em>“And then I was like, ‘Fold this!’ and folded that gonk all over the place.”</em></p>\n<p>As an Action, the weapon’s stock/frame/etc can be folded or unfolded. While folded, the weapon is concealable despite any other installed Attachments excluding Drum Mag and Belt Box. While the weapon is folded, the user suffers a -2 penalty to all Attack Checks made with it. While installed, the weapon cannot be installed into Popup Weapon Cyberware. This attachment cannot be installed into a Magrail Kit.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Internal Components).</em></p>"
